          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"analise-da-construcao-incremental\">An\u00e1lise da constru\u00e7\u00e3o incremental</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Hor\u00e1rio</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Tempo</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Aulas alteradas (vs H0)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>H0</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><code>0.0497431755065918</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">N/A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>H1 (do zero)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><code>0.0480349063873291</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><code>31</code> aulas alteradas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>H1 (incremental)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><code>0.039989471435546875</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><code>0</code> aulas alteradas</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Temos uma diferen\u00e7a de tempo entre H1 (do zero) e H1 (incremental) de <code>0.008045434951782227</code> segundos.</span>\n<h3 id=\"visualizacao-interativa-de-horarios\">Visualiza\u00e7\u00e3o interativa de hor\u00e1rios</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-ui-element object-id='RGSE-9' random-id='55a4c74b-ab08-cfd9-8205-17946af7cec6'><marimo-tabs data-initial-value='&quot;&quot;' data-label='null' data-tabs='[&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eH0 (original)&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;,&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eH1 (do zero)&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;,&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eH1 (incremental)&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;]' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;'><div data-kind='tab'><marimo-ui-element object-id='RGSE-2' random-id='7d8146be-38fa-6f88-ba50-fecfe7211fd8'><marimo-tabs data-initial-value='&quot;&quot;' data-label='null' data-tabs='[&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eTurma 7\u00baA&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;,&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eTurma 7\u00baB&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;]' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;'><div data-kind='tab'><marimo-ui-element object-id='RGSE-0' random-id='9c5ef8bd-d277-41dd-2b69-ff9032138682'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;Periodo&#92;&quot;:1,&#92;&quot;Seg&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Ter&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Qua&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Qui&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Ci&#92;&#92;u00eancias&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Sex&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Periodo&#92;&quot;:2,&#92;&quot;Seg&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Portugu&#92;&#92;u00eas&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Ter&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Matem&#92;&#92;u00e1tica&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Qua&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Portugu&#92;&#92;u00eas&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Qui&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Matem&#92;&#92;u00e1tica&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Sex&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Matem&#92;&#92;u00e1tica&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Periodo&#92;&quot;:3,&#92;&quot;Seg&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Matem&#92;&#92;u00e1tica&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Ter&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Ingl&#92;&#92;u00eas&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Q